{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_06_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_06",
  "title": "邂逅",
  "storyCode": "RI-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b40256020e03d7178c6e53c8513fa0f39db31a37dfc8136a2a16e433d5037e20",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungleentrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么只有你们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族长A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巨木部族的人不见了，我听说好像他们的首领被一个外来者打败了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火石部族还有粗尾部族被一个不知道哪里来的背着很多武器的家伙给全打趴下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族长A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有几个部族选择了加入祖玛玛的部族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族长B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老实说，祖玛玛搞出来的阵仗真厉害，要不是我是嘉维尔的追随者，说不定也要去加入祖玛玛了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有你们几个部族的人也足够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族长B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，我们真的能战胜祖玛玛吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉维尔一定能够战胜祖玛玛的巨大机器，到时候，就由我来成为大酋长，让嘉维尔留下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "佩塔觉得，这样不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，这是唯一能让嘉维尔留下来的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要忘了，我们是为了什么才成立的“嘉维尔意志”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“嘉维尔意志”不只是一个部族，是我们所有希望嘉维尔成为大酋长的人的联盟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族长B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我支持特米米，我只认嘉维尔做大酋长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族长A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错，嘉维尔才是应该领导我们的人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "族长C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，要是我不同意，我就不会站在这里了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......佩塔不喜欢，但是佩塔会做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么你们到了祖玛玛部族外面等我来找你们，明白了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "其他族长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，一切都是为了嘉维尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "其他族长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一切都是为了嘉维尔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，还有其他人也在！太好了，终于找到你们了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，博士，你可把我担心坏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？煌，你怎么就把泳装穿——你的背上怎么还有个人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这小姑娘是我刚才走在路上遇到的，也不知道怎么回事见面就打我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我肯定打回去啊，就把她和她手下全给打趴下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不得不说这小姑娘身手还不错，也挺抗打，我就带上了，想着找到你之后让你帮我问问为什么要打我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，克玛尔的话，我觉得她大概就是单纯看你挺厉害，就想跟你打一架，这家伙可是个战斗狂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，能被你这么评价的家伙还真是稀奇啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我又不是战斗狂，我只是习惯用比较直接的方法解决问题而已啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行行行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这里是......哪里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你醒了，克玛尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉维尔？！你怎么在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你遇到了我的同伴，对她出手然后被她打倒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，你终于醒了，小姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，嘉维尔，她干什么，怎么刚醒就忽然向我弯腰了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克玛尔，你要干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在她身上感受到了连我在祖玛玛身上都没感受过的更纯粹的强大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉维尔，我对你失去兴趣了。你好像能和她交流，帮我告诉她，请指导我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，她说让你教她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啥？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大概意思就是觉得你太强了，想做你小弟，这样的感觉吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......博士，怎么办啊，我从没遇到过这种事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这要由你来决定。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "不关我事。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，要不让她先跟着我们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也行，喂，克玛尔，你先跟着我们好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，现在，叫我燧石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起来，祭典怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你来给煌讲解一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不惜让手下感染矿石病也要造机器？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，这我可不能坐视不管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那还等什么，博士，继续前进吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，我们还有另一个地方要去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
